  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia - Ndola Water and Sanitation Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Zambie - Projet d&apos;approvisionnement en eau et d&apos;assainissement de Ndola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. OVERALL OBJECTIVE : To improve public health and to foster the socio-economic development of the community.  2. SPECIFIC OBJECTIVES : The project was intended to develop an established ground water resource to augment the capacity of water supply system of Ndola to meet the growing demands of the community at least upto the year 1984.</narrative>
